{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe basin here is vast, three to four hours wide, wedged between the mountain ranges that separate Saxony from Bohemia. From the Schloßberg, the view is commanding, stretching all the way to Aussig on the Elbe. I walked the town today, observing the flow of people with the usual curiosity.\n\nIn the evening, I attended the theatre. I confess, I was somewhat bored by *Preciosa*. The plot felt thin, and the acting lacked the necessary gravity. I found myself wondering if the audience would agree, or if they are simply content with pleasant distraction. It reminded me of our conversations here in Berlin; sometimes the public demands only entertainment, not depth.\n\nThe air is sharp, and the walk did me good. I miss the warmth of our home and the sound of the boys. Tell me how Karl and Immanuel fare in their studies. I hope they are applying themselves with the requisite discipline, rather than merely chasing amusement.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795219094,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":213,"prompt_tokens":950,"total_tokens":1163,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-ZfRWVcGneCow62I7Qi5wgQqMUe0JIr81","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":950,"prompt_ms":972.494,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0236778947368421,"prompt_per_second":976.8697801734509,"predicted_n":213,"predicted_ms":5095.651,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.03608962264151,"predicted_per_second":41.60410514770341}}